## 3. System Features

### 3.1 User Registration and Authentication
**Priority:** High  

**Functional Requirements:**  
- System shall provide Angular-based registration form with real-time validation  
- Node.js backend shall handle user authentication with JWT tokens  
- System shall store credentials securely in Neon database  
- Email verification upon registration  
- Password requirements: 8+ chars, special chars  
- Password reset via email  
- Optional OAuth integration (Google, GitHub)  
- Frontend shall maintain user session state  
- Secure logout functionality  

*(Other system features like Book Catalog Management, Book Discovery, AI Recommendations, Community Features, Communication, Rating & Reviews are similar—can be included in Markdown tables for functional requirements.)*

