## 4. External Interface Requirements

### 4.1 User Interfaces
- **Frontend:** Angular 17+  
- Responsive design with Bootstrap or Angular Material  
- Modular Angular components  
- State Management: NgRx  
- Angular Router for SPA navigation  
- PWA capabilities  

**Key Interface Components:**  

| Interface | Angular Implementation | Priority |
|-----------|----------------------|----------|
| Dashboard | Main component with recommendation widgets | High |
| Book Catalog | Data table component with sorting/filtering/pagination | High |
| Search Interface | Search component with auto-complete | High |
| Request Management | Form components with real-time updates | High |
| Community Hub | Social components with discussion threads/events | Medium |
| Profile Management | Reactive forms for user settings | Medium |

### 4.2 Hardware Interfaces
- Camera access (ISBN scanning)  
- Geolocation API  
- Local storage for offline  
- Push Notification API  

### 4.3 Software Interfaces
**Backend APIs:** Authentication, Book Management, Search, Recommendation, Communication, Community  

**External APIs:** Google Books, OpenLibrary, Google Maps, Email, GitHub  

**Database Interfaces:** Neon Serverless PostgreSQL with ORM (Prisma/TypeORM)  

### 4.4 Communication Interfaces
- HTTPS, WebSocket, REST API, optional GraphQL  
- JSON primary format, TypeScript interfaces, CSV for import/export  

