## 5. Non-Functional Requirements

### 5.1 Performance
- Angular initial page load < 3s, component render < 500ms  
- Node.js API auth < 200ms, book search < 500ms  
- Neon query response < 100ms for indexed queries  

### 5.2 Scalability
- Horizontal scaling, load balancing, CDN integration, modular microservices  
- Neon auto-scaling, read replicas, optimized queries  

### 5.3 Security
- Frontend: XSS prevention, HTTPS, input validation, JWT route guards  
- Backend: JWT auth, input sanitization, rate limiting, CORS config  
- Database: Encryption, SSL, role-based access, audit logging  

### 5.4 Reliability and Availability
- Uptime 99.5%, automated backups, deployment rollback, health monitoring  

### 5.5 Maintainability
- TypeScript, ESLint/Prettier, Jest/Jasmine/Cypress, minimum 80% code coverage  
- GitHub docs, API specs, inline comments, versioning, changelogs  

